    "Connect using this fork’s Desktop OAuth client. New files stay private in My Drive; sharing is unchanged. The app requests access only to files you create or open with it. Tokens stay in this Mac’s Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此分支的桌面 OAuth 客户端连接。新文件在“我的云端硬盘”中保持私密，共享设置不变。应用只请求访问你通过它创建或打开的文件，令牌保存在此 Mac 的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
