    "File Search reads your disk directly to build a private index on this Mac. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access, turn on Tinycast. If it isn’t listed, click + and choose Tinycast from Applications. If access still shows as required, quit and reopen Tinycast.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
