      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "斜体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its enclosing folder isn’t writable by you, and Tinycast never asks for an administrator password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你无法写入所在文件夹，Tinycast 也不会请求管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its global shortcut and launcher references go with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其全局快捷键和启动器引用也会删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its instructions, shortcut and learned ranking go with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其指令、快捷键和学习排序也会删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its menu changed before the press landed. Search again and retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "执行前菜单已变化，请重新搜索并重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its private support folder could not be prepared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法准备其专用支持文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its saved API key will also be deleted from Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其 API 密钥也会从钥匙串中删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its shortcut and launcher references go with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其快捷键和启动器引用也会删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its shortcut, favorite slot and learned ranking go with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其快捷键、收藏位置和学习排序也会删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its tools stop being offered, and its stored credentials are deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将停止提供其工具，并删除已存储的凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its windows stay open. Its shortcut goes with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口保持打开，快捷键会被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
