        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast is ready. Set a shortcut in Settings to summon it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 已就绪。在设置中配置快捷键即可唤出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast leaves it alone, and its models stay out of every model picker.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 不会修改它，其模型也不会显示在模型选择器中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs microphone access for dictation and Accessibility to paste into other apps. Audio is processed on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要麦克风权限进行听写，并通过辅助功能权限粘贴到其他应用。音频仅在本机处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs the Accessibility permission to read the selected text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要辅助功能权限才能读取所选文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs the Accessibility permission to read the text you have selected and replace it. If Tinycast is already listed, switch it off and on again — a rebuilt app keeps a stale entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要辅助功能权限来读取和回填所选文字。若已列出，请关闭后重新开启，重新构建的应用可能保留旧授权记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs the Accessibility permission to read the text you have selected in other apps and replace it. Nothing is read until you press a shortcut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要辅助功能权限来读取和回填其他应用中的所选文字，仅在按下快捷键时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast sends your selected text to the model with these instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 会按照这些指令将所选文字发送给模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast sets %@ itself, so this value is not used.": {
